.Sh CAVEATS
.Bl -bullet
.It
Xephyr graphics acceleration depends on the X server build and host
configuration; a specific renderer must not be assumed.
.It
There is no window manager inside the Xephyr display.
Applications run full-screen at the configured resolution.
If your application needs a session script, wrap it in a shell script
and pass that script as the command.
.It
.Nm
does not create a separate user account or use
.Xr doas 1 .
The application runs as your user, with only the configured unveil
filesystem restriction.
For additional user-based isolation, wrap the application with
.Xr doas 1
yourself or use the pre-2026 version of
.Nm
which included user sandboxing.
.It
.Nm
is a mitigation, not a guarantee.
A determined attacker who compromises the application may still find
ways to escape the sandbox.
Combine it with other
.Ox
security practices.
.El
